  "what": "Lane pairing for the BigCodeBench-derived A_coding tasks. Each entry is ONE upstream task delivered two ways: lane 1 = through OpenCode with tools and multiple turns (eval/tasks/A_coding/<harness_task>, graded by pytest_grader.py); lane 2 = straight at /v1/chat/completions, single turn, no agent (eval/external/bigcodebench/run_bcb.py, graded by BigCodeBench itself). Lane 1 minus lane 2, on the same task and the same assertions, is the harness contribution.",
